#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room1/scripts.inc:14
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room1_Text_Grunt1Intro"
msgid ""
"We don't need a kid around!\n"
"Go on home already!$"
msgstr ""
"这里不需要小孩子！\n"
"快点回家去吧！$"

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room1/scripts.inc:18
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room1_Text_Grunt1Defeat"
msgid "I want to go home…$"
msgstr "我想回家……$"

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room1/scripts.inc:21
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room1_Text_Grunt1PostBattle"
msgid ""
"I want to get a promotion so I can\n"
"boss around the GRUNTS…$"
msgstr ""
"我想升职，\n"
"这样就可以使唤手下了……$"

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room1/scripts.inc:25
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room1_Text_Grunt2Intro"
msgid ""
"That submarine… It's tiny inside.\n"
"I'm sore all over!$"
msgstr ""
"那艘潜水艇……里面好窄。\n"
"我浑身酸痛！$"

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room1/scripts.inc:29
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room1_Text_Grunt2Defeat"
msgid "Losing makes me sore!$"
msgstr "输了让我更痛了！$"

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room1/scripts.inc:32
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room1_Text_Grunt2PostBattle"
msgid ""
"That submarine we jacked, man,\n"
"it's brutal as a ride.\l"
"It's way too tight in there!$"
msgstr ""
"我们抢来的那艘潜水艇，\n"
"坐起来简直要命。\l"
"里面实在太挤了！$"
